  "h1": [
    "Dr. Alan Meskin, Prosthodontist and Implant Specialist"
  ],
  "word_count": 430,
  "body_markdown": "Hackensack, NJ\n\nAbout\n\nAbout UsDr. Alan MeskinDr. Maurice SrourDr. Won-Sang LeeDr. Dmitriy KlassOur TechnologyOffice Gallery\n\nServices\n\nAll ServicesDental ImplantsSingle Tooth ImplantsAll-On-XSmile MakeoversFull Mouth RehabilitationImplant BridgeImplant RevisionEmergency Dental ServicesSedation DentistryCost of Dental ImplantsDental Implant FAQs\n\nPatient Stories\n\nPatient TestimonialsBefore & After\n\nNew Patient\n\nYour First VisitInsurance & FinancingDental Implant FAQsPre Op & Post Op InstructionsBlogs\n\nDoctor Referral\n\nContact\n\nSchedule Your Consultation\n\nSCHEDULE FREE CONSULTATION\n\nSchedule Consultation\n\n\n# Dr. Alan Meskin, Prosthodontist and Implant Specialist\n\n\nNYU-trained and focused entirely on replacing and restoring teeth, Dr. Alan Meskin specializes in dental implants, full-mouth reconstruction, and cosmetic smile design, including the complex cases other offices refer out.\n\n\n## Meet Dr. Meskin\n\n\nDr. Alan Meskin is a prosthodontist, a dental specialist trained specifically in replacing and restoring teeth. He earned his Doctor of Dental Surgery from NYU College of Dentistry in 2019, then completed a further certificate in prosthodontics at NYU in 2022, focusing on implant restoration and full-mouth reconstruction. Dr. Meskin describes himself simply: a prosthodontist dedicated to smile design and full-mouth rehabilitation, with a focus on implant prosthetics. That focus is deliberate. By concentrating on replacing and restoring teeth rather than spreading across every area of dentistry, he is able to bring real depth to the cases that need it most.\n\nHis work centers on one goal: rebuilding smiles so naturally that no one can tell. Patients describe him as gentle and thorough, a dentist who takes the time to explain, listens first, and puts anxious patients at ease. He provides care in English, Spanish, and Russian. His philosophy is patient-first and detail-driven. Every plan begins by listening to what the patient actually wants, and every restoration is designed to look and function like a natural tooth. He is committed to continuing education, regularly taking courses and bringing the newest techniques in digital and implant dentistry back to his patients.\n\nDental implants, from a single tooth to a full arch\n\nFull-mouth reconstruction and rehabilitation\n\nCosmetic smile design and makeovers\n\nImplant revision and complex, referred-out cases\n\n\n## EDUCATION AND TRAINING\n\n\n\n### Education:\n\n\nDoctor of Dental Surgery (DDS), NYU College of Dentistry, 2019\n\nCertificate in Prosthodontics, NYU College of Dentistry, 2022\n\n\n### Specialty Training:\n\n\nThree-year accredited prosthodontics residency at NYU\n\nClinical training in implant restorations and full-mouth reconstruction\n\nAdvanced training in digital dentistry and CAD/CAM workflows\n\n\n### Areas of Expertise:\n\n\nImplant prosthetics\n\nFull-mouth rehabilitation\n\nCosmetic smile design\n\nRestorative dentistry (crowns, bridges, veneers)\n\n\n### Reimagine your dental experience\n\n\n\n### address\n\n\n163 Main Street, Suite A1,\n\nHackensack, NJ 07601\n\n(551) 368-2476\n\n\n### Hours\n\n\nMonday - Friday: 10:00 AM to 6:00 PM\n\nSaturday - Sunday: Closed\n\n\n### LANGUAGES\n\n\nEnglish\n\nEspañol\n\nРусский\n\nPortuguese\n\nKorean\n\nServing Hackensack and the Greater Bergen County Area\n\nCopyright © 2026 Hackensack Center for Dental Implants\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCookie Policy\n\nHIPAA Disclosure",
